OL,3,GNEWSA'Frustrated' teen drove at 140mph
OL,4,Aon way to gym before crashing into taxi
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "frustrated" teenager drove his car
OL,7,Fat more than 140mph (225km/h) on his
OL,8,Fway to the gym before crashing into a
OL,9,Ftaxi.
OL,11,FMax Dangerfield, now 20, was driving in
OL,12,Fthe early hours of 25 January 2025 on
OL,13,Fthe A48 near the Cross Hands roundabout
OL,14,Fin Llanelli, Carmarthenshire, when he
OL,15,Fploughed into the back of a taxi that
OL,16,Fwas taking two women home after a night
OL,17,Fout.
OL,19,FThe taxi driver suffered broken ribs,
OL,20,Fbleeds on the brain, a punctured lung
OL,21,Fand a lacerated liver in the crash.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
