OL,3,GNEWSA'Frustrated' teen drove at 140mph
OL,4,Aon way to gym before crashing into taxi
OL,5,
OL,6,FDangerfield, who was uninsured, was
OL,7,Fbanned from driving for 50 months at
OL,8,FSwansea Crown Court on 13 August, and
OL,9,Fmust serve 28 months detention in a
OL,10,Fyoung offenders institution.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
